WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.260
If you take injectable GLP-1 medications or other weight loss drugs such as

2
00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:04.880
phentermine,

3
00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:07.680
there's an important step to be aware of before your procedure.

4
00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:13.280
These medications slow digestion, which can affect how your stomach empties and

5
00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:14.080
may interfere with

6
00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:17.720
your prep. For that reason, your care team may ask you to hold your GLP-1

7
00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:19.360
before your colonoscopy.

8
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:23.190
Typically, you will need to hold your dose for one week, but if you are not

9
00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:23.440
sure,

10
00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:27.110
please call your doctor's office to confirm exactly when to take your last dose

11
00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:27.360
.

12
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.520
Do not stop or adjust any medication without speaking with them first.

13
00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:36.000
We just want to make sure everything goes smoothly on procedure day.
